14. AUDIO / PRONUNCIATION
==================================================

Implement Arabic pronunciation.

MVP:

Browser Web Speech API.

Example:

const utterance =
  new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(text);

utterance.lang = "ar-SA";

utterance.rate = 0.75;

utterance.pitch = 1;

window.speechSynthesis.cancel();

window.speechSynthesis.speak(utterance);


Create:

audioService.ts


Functions:

speakArabic(text)

stopSpeech()

pauseSpeech()

resumeSpeech()


Handle:

speech unavailable
voice unavailable
browser differences


Use graceful fallback.


Architecture must allow future replacement with:

Pre-generated MP3/WAV

CDN audio

Human recordings

Cloud TTS


Do not couple the UI directly to SpeechSynthesis.


